<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS6" title="In 5 Results and Discussion ‣ Foundations of LLM Knowledge Materialization:Termination, Reproducibility, Robustness" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.6 </span>Result Generalization</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
